      "value": "Also can confirm I recently uploaded a fallback, go into Fallback tab, set avatar as fallback, close and reopen menu, select Fallback tab again, shown fallback has reverted to the default robot.\n\nAlso tested this with a friend, he had a custom fallback already set for some time and was not able to change his fallback to another avatar (other than the VRChat supplied ones). It was still showing the same fallback he had selected sometime ago.",
